1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Eighth Episode
The Winged Horse

15
00:02:22,021 --> 00:02:25,172
Where am I?
I recognize that one!

16
00:02:25,221 --> 00:02:29,578
It's the ship that carries to Earth
the children who are to be born.

17
00:02:29,741 --> 00:02:32,096
I get it: I'm in Heaven!

18
00:02:32,741 --> 00:02:34,732
There, that's me!

19
00:02:39,541 --> 00:02:41,532
What a naughty little angel I was!

20
00:02:42,621 --> 00:02:44,612
I was always causing a lot of trouble.

21
00:02:44,661 --> 00:02:48,415
But I just wanted to have fun!
Life, up there, is so monotonous!

22
00:02:59,621 --> 00:03:01,612
These are the little
hearts of the children.

23
00:03:01,661 --> 00:03:04,653
The Lord divides them
like this: boys and girls.

24
00:03:04,781 --> 00:03:07,011
Come on, little one, open your mouth.

25
00:03:07,901 --> 00:03:11,940
Those who swallow the
hearts blue will be little boys,

26
00:03:11,981 --> 00:03:15,815
Those, on the other hand, who have pink
hearts will be little girls. Here!

27
00:03:15,861 --> 00:03:18,580
I stole a blue heart
from the basket!

28
00:03:19,381 --> 00:03:22,134
Hey, listen! Would you like
to be a little boy?

29
00:03:22,181 --> 00:03:24,217
I don't know what advantage there would be

30
00:03:24,261 --> 00:03:26,013
I will make a little boy out of you!

31
00:03:27,501 --> 00:03:30,174
What hard work!
Finally, I'm almost finished.

32
00:03:30,221 --> 00:03:33,213
Well, let's see...
You have a cute little face.

33
00:03:33,261 --> 00:03:35,729
I will make you a beautiful little girl!

34
00:03:35,781 --> 00:03:37,692
But I have already swallowed
a blue heart.

35
00:03:38,181 --> 00:03:42,254
What did you say? It must have been
Tink who made this mess!

36
00:03:42,301 --> 00:03:45,816
- Where did you hide?
- Forgive me, Lord!

37
00:03:45,861 --> 00:03:48,455
You little rascal! Do you know that now,
because of you, that child...

38
00:03:48,501 --> 00:03:52,733
won't know if he will have to live as a
little boy or as a little girl?

39
00:03:52,821 --> 00:03:55,654
Go to Earth
and take a heart from him!

40
00:03:55,781 --> 00:03:58,011
this is your punishment!

41
00:04:01,221 --> 00:04:03,337
Thank goodness I was only dreaming!

42
00:04:03,381 --> 00:04:06,100
But what I was dreaming
actually happened to me.

43
00:04:07,101 --> 00:04:08,932
I'm so sleepy!

44
00:04:49,421 --> 00:04:52,413
Tink! Tink, wake up!

45
00:05:00,541 --> 00:05:02,611
Who is playing these pranks?

46
00:05:02,661 --> 00:05:04,458
It's me, Tink!

47
00:05:07,621 --> 00:05:12,092
Pegasus! I am glad to see you
after all this time! How are you?

48
00:05:12,141 --> 00:05:14,416
What have you come to
do down here, on Earth?

49
00:05:14,461 --> 00:05:16,895
In Heaven,
does the Lord remember me?

50
00:05:16,941 --> 00:05:19,091
Is something wrong, Pegasus?

51
00:05:19,141 --> 00:05:21,416
You have not yet done
what God wanted from you.

52
00:05:21,461 --> 00:05:24,021
The Lord has lost His
patience and has tasked me...

53
00:05:24,061 --> 00:05:27,531
...to take the blue heart of
Sapphire and bring it back to Heaven.

54
00:05:27,581 --> 00:05:30,254
Wait a moment, Pegasus! It is
not my fault if I haven't taken it yet!

55
00:05:30,301 --> 00:05:32,292
I've had a series of difficulties!

56
00:05:32,341 --> 00:05:34,855
I know well
everything that has happened.

57
00:05:34,901 --> 00:05:38,052
From Heaven I can see
everything that happens on Earth.

58
00:05:38,141 --> 00:05:40,371
God's command is absolute.

59
00:05:40,421 --> 00:05:42,935
I am forced to take over
your duties, Tink,

60
00:05:42,981 --> 00:05:45,017
and you will never again
be an angel.

61
00:05:45,061 --> 00:05:47,017
Wait, Pegasus! I...

62
00:06:06,421 --> 00:06:08,491
How inconvenient it is to be a child!

63
00:06:08,541 --> 00:06:10,577
If I had the little wings
I had in Heaven,

64
00:06:10,621 --> 00:06:12,612
I could fly instead of walking!

65
00:06:12,661 --> 00:06:15,653
Who knows, maybe I can still
fly! I want to try!

66
00:06:17,460 --> 00:06:20,373
No luck! On Earth
it's a completely different thing!

67
00:06:21,260 --> 00:06:25,174
- There are people!
- Look, a winged horse!

68
00:06:25,220 --> 00:06:28,338
- How beautiful he is!
- Magnificent!

69
00:06:29,020 --> 00:06:31,740
Look! How wonderful!

70
00:06:31,780 --> 00:06:34,249
They say he lives in Heaven!

71
00:06:43,020 --> 00:06:46,218
Oh, no! Pegasus is going to the castle!
Sapphire is in danger!

72
00:06:53,660 --> 00:06:57,017
Your Majesty! Something extraordinary!
A marvel!

73
00:06:57,060 --> 00:06:59,620
A horse flying
toward the castle!

74
00:06:59,660 --> 00:07:02,016
What?! It must be Pegasus!

75
00:07:02,060 --> 00:07:04,655
- He's almost above us!
- Let's go see!

76
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:16,692
It's Pegasus, the winged horse!

77
00:07:16,740 --> 00:07:19,460
- What a magnificent beast!
- A unique sight in the world!

78
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:22,220
Perhaps he has come to bring
happiness to our kingdom.

79
00:07:22,260 --> 00:07:24,570
It is said that Pegasus
always brings happiness.

80
00:07:24,620 --> 00:07:27,499
What makes you think
that he has come for this reason?

81
00:07:28,020 --> 00:07:31,252
A legend states
that the countries where Pegasus descends...

82
00:07:31,300 --> 00:07:34,657
...become prosperous and happy,
so I hope he comes to us.

83
00:07:36,420 --> 00:07:38,457
I didn't know this legend

84
00:07:39,340 --> 00:07:42,060
Pegasus is flying away!
I must make him come here!

85
00:08:06,900 --> 00:08:10,814
Sapphire! Sapphire!
I must catch up to him!

86
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:14,020
Tink! Help me make
Pegasus come back!

87
00:08:14,060 --> 00:08:16,097
They say he brings happiness
with him!

88
00:08:16,140 --> 00:08:18,575
- He brings happiness?
- Yes! A legend says..

89
00:08:18,620 --> 00:08:20,896
...that wherever he
lands happiness arrives!

90
00:08:20,940 --> 00:08:23,455
Pegasus will not bring you
what you are hoping for, Sapphire!

91
00:08:23,500 --> 00:08:27,414
He has come to Earth to make
you become completely a girl!

92
00:08:41,340 --> 00:08:44,890
What damn good luck to have heard
about the legend of the winged horse!

93
00:09:59,861 --> 00:10:02,819
I've lost sight of him! I
must try to find him again!

94
00:10:02,861 --> 00:10:05,694
Listen to me: Pegasus will
not bring you happiness.

95
00:10:05,741 --> 00:10:07,811
Don't interfere! A
horse, even a winged one,

96
00:10:07,861 --> 00:10:11,092
He can't do what you say! He
can't have gone too far!

97
00:10:11,541 --> 00:10:13,816
Ah, there he is up there! He won't get away from me!

98
00:10:16,541 --> 00:10:20,773
The moment I've been waiting for has arrived:
finally Sapphire is left alone!

99
00:10:26,941 --> 00:10:29,535
Damn!
What could have happened?

100
00:10:29,581 --> 00:10:32,539
Just as I was
about to capture the winged horse...

101
00:10:34,221 --> 00:10:36,451
What? A net?!

102
00:10:36,901 --> 00:10:39,017
I must find out who did it!

103
00:10:42,901 --> 00:10:46,291
It's strange... I was sure
there was someone here!

104
00:10:48,021 --> 00:10:51,570
- Baron Nylon! - Hello, Prince!
What are you doing in these parts?

105
00:10:51,621 --> 00:10:53,816
I'm looking for a winged horse!
Have you seen it?

106
00:10:53,861 --> 00:10:56,056
You must be joking?!
A winged horse?!

107
00:10:56,101 --> 00:10:59,650
Yes! Pegasus, the horse that
brings happiness wherever he lands!

108
00:10:59,701 --> 00:11:02,010
But I fear they've captured him.
Do you know anything about it?

109
00:11:02,061 --> 00:11:05,019
No, Prince! I was passing by here
by chance and saw nothing.

110
00:11:05,341 --> 00:11:07,616
If this horse
brings happiness,

111
00:11:07,661 --> 00:11:09,492
I hope you find him
as soon as possible.

112
00:11:09,541 --> 00:11:11,497
Goodbye, Prince.

113
00:11:15,821 --> 00:11:18,255
It was easy to deceive
that stupid brat!

114
00:11:19,501 --> 00:11:22,174
He has no idea that it was
me who captured Pegasus!

115
00:11:23,181 --> 00:11:25,456
I've had a splendid idea!

116
00:11:40,261 --> 00:11:42,821
It's not bad, this magical
house of the Grand Duke.

117
00:11:49,421 --> 00:11:53,016
First I scared the brat with
the dynamite that I was given...

118
00:11:53,061 --> 00:11:55,336
...and then I managed
to capture that horse.

119
00:11:55,901 --> 00:11:58,256
I have never seen
such a splendid horse!

120
00:11:58,301 --> 00:12:01,498
Nylon, are you really sure
that it will bring us happiness?

121
00:12:02,021 --> 00:12:04,137
But of course, Baron Duralumin!

122
00:12:04,581 --> 00:12:06,697
Let go of my nose right now!

123
00:12:06,741 --> 00:12:08,891
Bites on my nose
do not make me happy!

124
00:12:08,941 --> 00:12:10,897
You are an idiot!

125
00:12:10,941 --> 00:12:13,455
Please calm down!
Don't take it out on me!

126
00:12:13,501 --> 00:12:15,856
After all, I brought you
a one-of-a-kind horse!

127
00:12:15,901 --> 00:12:18,210
I've had a great idea,
dear Grand Duke!

128
00:12:18,261 --> 00:12:20,377
- Listen to me!
- What?

129
00:12:20,421 --> 00:12:22,491
- Sapphire is...?
- Yes, yes!

130
00:12:23,021 --> 00:12:24,818
Looking for that horse!

131
00:12:24,861 --> 00:12:27,056
This is a great opportunity
to eliminate the Prince!

132
00:12:27,101 --> 00:12:31,140
Good! Baron Nylon, you
are smarter than I thought!

133
00:12:31,181 --> 00:12:33,217
Thank you for the compliment!

134
00:12:41,581 --> 00:12:45,290
See? We just need to choose the
one that looks the most like Pegasus!

135
00:12:45,341 --> 00:12:47,218
Not this one, not this one.

136
00:12:47,261 --> 00:12:50,492
Definitely not: its muzzle
is a bit too rounded.

137
00:12:50,661 --> 00:12:54,051
Of this other colt, however,
it's the eyes that I don't like.

138
00:12:54,221 --> 00:12:56,416
It will have to be a
very elegant horse.

139
00:12:57,021 --> 00:12:59,819
But they are all elegant like
this! Which one to choose?

140
00:13:09,421 --> 00:13:11,616
I've finished! Admire
my masterpiece!

141
00:13:11,781 --> 00:13:15,012
Yes, you've done a good
job. I admire your skill.

142
00:13:15,061 --> 00:13:17,416
Now there is nothing left
for us to do but put this wasp...

143
00:13:17,461 --> 00:13:19,929
...into the ear of the
fake Pegasus and wait.

144
00:13:19,981 --> 00:13:22,017
I've anesthetized it, but
as soon as it wakes up...

145
00:13:22,061 --> 00:13:24,017
...it will start
buzzing in its ear!

146
00:13:24,061 --> 00:13:26,291
And when Sapphire sees the horse
on the ground, she will think that...

147
00:14:07,341 --> 00:14:09,536
I wonder if I'll be
able to find Pegasus..!

148
00:14:09,941 --> 00:14:11,738
He's on the tower!

149
00:14:12,021 --> 00:14:15,093
Wait, Sapphire! Listen!
That Pegasus is fake!

150
00:14:15,141 --> 00:14:17,177
That horse's wings are fake!

151
00:14:17,221 --> 00:14:20,054
Listen! Sapphire, wait!

152
00:14:21,021 --> 00:14:23,012
I managed to catch you!

153
00:14:23,421 --> 00:14:26,219
Soon, the wasp should
wake up and then...

154
00:14:26,821 --> 00:14:28,812
Come on, little horse!
Start flying!

155
00:14:28,861 --> 00:14:30,817
Three, two, one... Here we go!

156
00:14:30,861 --> 00:14:34,297
Hey, what are you doing?
What's happening to you?

157
00:14:35,421 --> 00:14:37,412
Stop!

158
00:14:38,541 --> 00:14:42,295
Don't jump like that, please!
Stop!

159
00:14:44,701 --> 00:14:47,169
Help!

160
00:14:51,781 --> 00:14:55,410
Sapphire, hold on! Don't fall!
What can I do? Hold on, please!

161
00:14:56,021 --> 00:14:58,615
Calm down, come on!
Don't fret, little horse!

162
00:14:58,661 --> 00:15:00,936
He won't make it! Opal, help him!

163
00:15:05,941 --> 00:15:11,015
Help! Help! Help!

164
00:15:15,501 --> 00:15:17,571
Good heavens, he's plummeting!

165
00:15:20,301 --> 00:15:24,010
Thank heaven! Sapphire! Sapphire!

166
00:15:24,341 --> 00:15:27,014
Sapphire, how are you? Are
you alright? How do you feel?

167
00:15:29,301 --> 00:15:31,895
It was this wasp
that made the horse bolt.

168
00:15:31,941 --> 00:15:35,536
Someone put it in his ear
on purpose to get you killed.

169
00:15:35,701 --> 00:15:39,614
This colt is not Pegasus. Who
could have set up this trick?

170
00:15:39,661 --> 00:15:43,017
I'm sure it was Nylon who
played this other dirty trick on me!

171
00:15:46,901 --> 00:15:49,415
But why does that damn
brat have to be so lucky?

172
00:15:49,461 --> 00:15:51,611
I can never finish him off,
damn it!

173
00:15:52,341 --> 00:15:55,492
- Damn it!
- Nylon, what are you doing here?

174
00:15:56,021 --> 00:15:58,489
Hello, Prince!
I'm taking a walk!

175
00:15:58,541 --> 00:16:00,850
I see you are well and healthy!
I'm glad!

176
00:16:00,901 --> 00:16:03,734
- Goodbye.
- No, wait!

177
00:16:04,261 --> 00:16:07,731
And now tell me: why did you
deceive me with that fake Pegasus?

178
00:16:07,781 --> 00:16:09,658
Where is the real one? Speak!

179
00:16:09,701 --> 00:16:11,498
But what are you talking about,
Prince?

180
00:16:11,541 --> 00:16:14,009
- I assure you I know nothing about it!
- You are a liar!

181
00:16:14,701 --> 00:16:18,011
It was you who captured him
and you are hiding him yourself!

182
00:16:18,061 --> 00:16:21,531
If you think so, see for yourself
with your own eyes. Search for him!

183
00:16:22,501 --> 00:16:24,935
Come, please! I will lead the way.

184
00:16:34,021 --> 00:16:35,818
Look! Go ahead and look!

185
00:16:37,021 --> 00:16:39,740
Here... and here! And here!

186
00:16:40,381 --> 00:16:42,895
That's enough! I'll
never find him this way!

187
00:16:42,941 --> 00:16:45,455
I will find out where you are
keeping him hidden, Baron Nylon!

188
00:16:45,501 --> 00:16:47,253
And I will punish you!

189
00:16:55,021 --> 00:16:58,138
Dear Opal, I still need
your help.

190
00:16:58,501 --> 00:17:02,210
I am sure that with your sense of smell you
will succeed in finding where Pegasus is.

191
00:17:02,261 --> 00:17:04,252
Go find him, please!

192
00:17:36,221 --> 00:17:38,655
- This time you must not fail.
- Of course not!

193
00:17:38,701 --> 00:17:40,293
I had already planned
the second move...

194
00:17:40,341 --> 00:17:42,252
..and the next trap
will be perfect!

195
00:17:42,301 --> 00:17:45,020
Do you know who we will
use this time? The real Pegasus!

196
00:17:49,021 --> 00:17:51,581
- Are you Prince Sapphire?
- Yes, it's me.

197
00:17:53,021 --> 00:17:55,296
- And who are you?
- I am a poor old man.

198
00:17:55,341 --> 00:17:57,332
My brothers and I
live in the woods.

199
00:17:57,381 --> 00:17:59,690
We saw a winged
horse injured in one leg...

200
00:17:59,741 --> 00:18:01,333
..at the foot of the mountain..

201
00:18:01,381 --> 00:18:03,497
...and we wanted to warn
you: maybe that horse is yours.

202
00:18:03,581 --> 00:18:06,095
But Pegasus heals quickly
from his wounds.

203
00:18:09,021 --> 00:18:11,740
- We'll see!
- He's onto us! Let's finish him off!

204
00:18:11,781 --> 00:18:14,011
Let's get him!

205
00:18:22,501 --> 00:18:25,140
Speak! Do you know
where Nylon put Pegasus?

206
00:18:25,181 --> 00:18:28,332
- Yes...
- Then, if you value your life, you will lead me to him!

207
00:18:40,901 --> 00:18:42,300
There he is!

208
00:18:43,021 --> 00:18:46,411
It's really him!
Now you can leave!

209
00:18:47,701 --> 00:18:51,410
There's the Prince!
Get ready! He's coming!

210
00:18:51,461 --> 00:18:53,736
Spring the traps!

211
00:18:54,421 --> 00:18:57,538
What's happening?
Stop! I'm your colleague!

212
00:19:05,621 --> 00:19:08,010
Idiots! That's not the Prince!

213
00:19:08,061 --> 00:19:11,451
- But it looked like him!
- Why are you such idiots?!

214
00:19:11,501 --> 00:19:14,015
Here is Sapphire! Are you ready?

215
00:19:15,341 --> 00:19:17,252
Pull!

216
00:19:24,621 --> 00:19:26,293
Here I am, Pegasus!

217
00:19:31,781 --> 00:19:35,012
- Sapphire, we're here!
- Be careful, Tink!

218
00:19:35,061 --> 00:19:37,017
I will kill you!

219
00:20:11,701 --> 00:20:14,420
I've wanted to meet you
in person for a long time.

220
00:20:14,461 --> 00:20:16,816
Today I will take
your life, Prince!

221
00:20:23,341 --> 00:20:25,138
Have at you!

222
00:20:25,901 --> 00:20:28,017
I will cut off your head!

223
00:20:29,461 --> 00:20:31,019
Like this!

224
00:20:44,541 --> 00:20:46,930
That was a close call,
they almost killed you!

225
00:20:47,021 --> 00:20:48,818
Pegasus!

226
00:20:49,021 --> 00:20:51,091
You're safe, Pegasus!

227
00:20:51,141 --> 00:20:54,258
Please, Sapphire, don't ride
Pegasus! It's dangerous!

228
00:21:02,021 --> 00:21:06,014
Stop, Pegasus! Wait, Sapphire!
Listen to me!

229
00:21:10,181 --> 00:21:14,015
Sapphire, get down! You don't know what
you're doing! It's starting to rain...!

230
00:21:16,541 --> 00:21:19,214
Tink! Tink!

231
00:21:20,501 --> 00:21:22,253
Sapphire!

232
00:21:31,221 --> 00:21:34,372
Look, Opal: they are heading
towards that church on the mountain!

233
00:22:04,341 --> 00:22:06,252
And now what do you want to do?

234
00:22:16,101 --> 00:22:19,093
Stop, Pegasus!
Don't take the blue heart!

235
00:22:19,141 --> 00:22:21,291
If you take it away from her,
she will be killed by the evil ones..

236
00:22:21,341 --> 00:22:24,139
...who want to take over
her kingdom! Do you understand, Pegasus?

237
00:22:24,301 --> 00:22:26,496
Sapphire must remain
with a male heart,

238
00:22:26,541 --> 00:22:29,578
until she defeats the enemies
who lurk among her people!

239
00:22:29,621 --> 00:22:32,010
That is why she prefers
to have a boy's heart!

240
00:22:32,061 --> 00:22:34,621
Otherwise the people
will fall into the hands of the wicked!

241
00:22:34,661 --> 00:22:37,494
Leave Sapphire as she is
until she has rendered them harmless!

242
00:22:37,541 --> 00:22:40,851
If you insist on wanting to take from her
the heart I gave her in Heaven,

243
00:22:40,901 --> 00:22:42,892
I will fight you to prevent it!

244
00:22:42,941 --> 00:22:46,251
Tell the Lord that I myself will return
Sapphire's blue heart to Him

245
00:22:46,301 --> 00:22:49,179
when in Silverland
peace reigns once again.

246
00:22:54,701 --> 00:22:58,011
I am so happy!
You understood us, didn't you, Pegasus?

247
00:23:00,181 --> 00:23:01,819
Pegasus!

248
00:23:01,861 --> 00:23:05,171
Tell the Lord I'm sorry
for the trouble I've caused.

249
00:23:23,541 --> 00:23:26,692
- Goodbye, Pegasus!
- His mission is over

250
00:23:26,741 --> 00:23:29,096
Now he is returning to Heaven
and will report everything to the Lord.

251
00:23:29,141 --> 00:23:31,097
Goodbye, Pegasus!

252
00:23:49,741 --> 00:23:53,893
Tink, I've realized that happiness
is not thanks to a winged horse.

253
00:23:54,101 --> 00:23:56,569
It must be earned
with sacrifices.

254
00:23:56,941 --> 00:24:00,695
And I will try for my people
and for my country!

255
00:24:40,580 --> 00:24:44,200
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

